{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRFT a silly, whacky drifting roguelike where you control a car that should not be controlled! Bouncing from walls, maintaining control all while frantically shooting at chasing enemies! Upgrade over-the-top weapons that wreck havoc to anything in their path and go even crazier when you drift around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/7854d7626dd2e08e60d44fb8dc077ee4.avif?t=1758874605\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/77a36a6af1165d5014dec9e87168eb52.poster.avif?t=1758874605\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/77a36a6af1165d5014dec9e87168eb52.webm?t=1758874605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/77a36a6af1165d5014dec9e87168eb52.mp4?t=1758874605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Braking is for losers!, steer left and right and use the walls to bounce around!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple two button drifting controls</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drifting empowers you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/69e6228627851bd995a123113dc8e1fb.poster.avif?t=1758874605\" width=422 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/69e6228627851bd995a123113dc8e1fb.webm?t=1758874605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/69e6228627851bd995a123113dc8e1fb.mp4?t=1758874605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When drifting you reach the empowered<strong> <i>DRFT State</i></strong>\u00a0where your weapons go bananas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay empowered for a short duration and mow through enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get back to drifting to recharge yourself!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i> </i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/58798456ed8965049f84c5e20aa575b8.poster.avif?t=1758874605\" width=798 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/58798456ed8965049f84c5e20aa575b8.webm?t=1758874605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/58798456ed8965049f84c5e20aa575b8.mp4?t=1758874605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Criss Cross Upgrading</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades can be applied to all weapons and overlap across all of them!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep clearing waves to gain as many upgrades as possible</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 120 upgrades to collect</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/267ca52e1695eb955df83fe76af405e3.poster.avif?t=1758874605\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"ht